  "economic_hypothesis": "On the DEVELOPMENT_ONLY non-BTC linear USDT futures panel, a confirmed cross-sectional low realized-volatility rank state (CS-RV-rank <= 0.20 for >= 2 consecutive bars) admits a continuation entry with the short-horizon signed return. After canonical fees and slippage, this low-vol continuation admission is hypothesized to produce a more robust economic expectation than the identical unconditional 20-bar channel-breakout baseline. The edge is quiet-instrument trend persistence under low CS-RV rank — opposite half/direction to CSHRVF high-vol fade — and is not VTDC/VTSR/VEFCF/VEPC/VCEB/VCB.",
